### TITLE ###
TypingAndSubmitting
### DESCRIPTION ###
The cursor glyph sits where the next rune will land, and submitting collapses
the field to the prompt plus the value.
### PROMPT ###
>
### KEYS ###
"hello"
enter
### VALUE ###
hello
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
>█
--- frame 1 (h) ---
>h█
--- frame 2 (e) ---
>he█
--- frame 3 (l) ---
>hel█
--- frame 4 (l) ---
>hell█
--- frame 5 (o) ---
>hello█
--- frame 6 (enter) ---
>hello

### TITLE ###
CursorMovesAndInsertsMidText
### DESCRIPTION ###
Left moves the cursor without deleting, so the next rune is inserted where the
glyph sits rather than appended.
### PROMPT ###
>
### KEYS ###
"ac"
left
"b"
enter
### VALUE ###
abc
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
>█
--- frame 1 (a) ---
>a█
--- frame 2 (c) ---
>ac█
--- frame 3 (left) ---
>a█c
--- frame 4 (b) ---
>ab█c
--- frame 5 (enter) ---
>abc

### TITLE ###
Backspace
### DESCRIPTION ###
Backspace removes the rune before the cursor.
### PROMPT ###
>
### KEYS ###
"abc"
backspace
enter
### VALUE ###
ab
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
>█
--- frame 1 (a) ---
>a█
--- frame 2 (b) ---
>ab█
--- frame 3 (c) ---
>abc█
--- frame 4 (backspace) ---
>ab█
--- frame 5 (enter) ---
>ab

### TITLE ###
HomeAndEndJumpToTheEnds
### DESCRIPTION ###
Home puts the cursor before the first rune and End after the last, so typing
after each lands at opposite ends of the value.
### PROMPT ###
>
### KEYS ###
"bc"
home
"a"
end
"d"
enter
### VALUE ###
abcd
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
>█
--- frame 1 (b) ---
>b█
--- frame 2 (c) ---
>bc█
--- frame 3 (home) ---
>█bc
--- frame 4 (a) ---
>a█bc
--- frame 5 (end) ---
>abc█
--- frame 6 (d) ---
>abcd█
--- frame 7 (enter) ---
>abcd

### TITLE ###
CancelLeavesNoSummary
### DESCRIPTION ###
Ctrl-C returns no value, and the last frame is the interactive render rather
than a summary of a value that was never submitted.
### PROMPT ###
>
### KEYS ###
"x"
ctrl-c
### VALUE ###
<canceled>
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
>█
--- frame 1 (x) ---
>x█
